 "captions": [
  {
   "text": "Grandpa, my phone says",
   "s": 0,
   "e": 0.8,
   "line": 1,
   "sp": "B"
  },
  {
   "text": "I'm at the fire.",
   "s": 0.86,
   "e": 1.5,
   "line": 1,
   "sp": "B"
  },
  {
   "text": "How does it know?",
   "s": 1.56,
   "e": 2.26,
   "line": 1,
   "sp": "B"
  },
  {
   "text": "Satellites. Twenty thousand kilometres up.",
   "s": 2.32,
   "e": 4.55,
   "line": 2,
   "sp": "A"
  },
  {
   "text": "They only say the time.",
   "s": 4.62,
   "e": 5.56,
   "line": 2,
   "sp": "A"
  },
  {
   "text": "Just the time?",
   "s": 5.62,
   "e": 6.28,
   "line": 3,
   "sp": "B"
  },
  {
   "text": "That's all?",
   "s": 6.34,
   "e": 7.02,
   "line": 3,
   "sp": "B"
  },
  {
   "text": "Over and over.",
   "s": 7.08,
   "e": 7.8,
   "line": 4,
   "sp": "A"
  },
  {
   "text": "Your phone hears it",
   "s": 7.86,
   "e": 8.44,
   "line": 4,
   "sp": "A"
  },
  {
   "text": "a tiny bit late.",
   "s": 8.5,
   "e": 9.4,
   "line": 4,
   "sp": "A"
  },
  {
   "text": "Late by how much?",
   "s": 9.46,
   "e": 10.4,
   "line": 5,
   "sp": "B"
  },
  {
   "text": "Enough to measure.",
   "s": 10.46,
   "e": 11.37,
   "line": 6,
   "sp": "A"
  },
  {
   "text": "Late times the speed",
   "s": 11.54,
   "e": 12.34,
   "line": 6,
   "sp": "A"
  },
  {
   "text": "of light is distance.",
   "s": 12.4,
   "e": 13.5,
   "line": 6,
   "sp": "A"
  },
  {
   "text": "So one satellite says I'm",
   "s": 13.56,
   "e": 14.56,
   "line": 7,
   "sp": "B"
  },
  {
   "text": "this far from it.",
   "s": 14.62,
   "e": 15.42,
   "line": 7,
   "sp": "B"
  },
  {
   "text": "A ball of possible places.",
   "s": 15.48,
   "e": 16.9,
   "line": 8,
   "sp": "A"
  },
  {
   "text": "Four satellites,",
   "s": 16.96,
   "e": 17.84,
   "line": 8,
   "sp": "A"
  },
  {
   "text": "four balls.",
   "s": 17.9,
   "e": 18.75,
   "line": 8,
   "sp": "A"
  },
  {
   "text": "They cross in one spot.",
   "s": 18.9,
   "e": 20.11,
   "line": 8,
   "sp": "A"
  },
  {
   "text": "That's you.",
   "s": 20.36,
   "e": 20.88,
   "line": 8,
   "sp": "A"
  },
  {
   "text": "Why four?",
   "s": 20.94,
   "e": 21.38,
   "line": 9,
   "sp": "B"
  },
  {
   "text": "Three would cross.",
   "s": 21.44,
   "e": 22.14,
   "line": 9,
   "sp": "B"
  },
  {
   "text": "Your phone's clock is cheap.",
   "s": 22.2,
   "e": 23.53,
   "line": 10,
   "sp": "A"
  },
  {
   "text": "The fourth one fixes it.",
   "s": 23.7,
   "e": 24.76,
   "line": 10,
   "sp": "A"
  },
  {
   "text": "Light is fast.",
   "s": 24.82,
   "e": 25.78,
   "line": 11,
   "sp": "B"
  },
  {
   "text": "One tiny mistake and",
   "s": 25.84,
   "e": 26.8,
   "line": 11,
   "sp": "B"
  },
  {
   "text": "I'm in the ocean?",
   "s": 26.86,
   "e": 27.66,
   "line": 11,
   "sp": "B"
  },
  {
   "text": "A millionth of a second",
   "s": 27.72,
   "e": 28.48,
   "line": 12,
   "sp": "A"
  },
  {
   "text": "is three hundred metres.",
   "s": 28.54,
   "e": 29.26,
   "line": 12,
   "sp": "A"
  },
  {
   "text": "So the satellites carry atomic clocks,",
   "s": 29.32,
   "e": 31.3,
   "line": 12,
   "sp": "A"
  },
  {
   "text": "and Einstein corrects them.",
   "s": 31.36,
   "e": 32.74,
   "line": 12,
   "sp": "A"
  },
  {
   "text": "Thirty-eight microseconds a day.",
   "s": 32.8,
   "e": 34.28,
   "line": 12,
   "sp": "A"
  },
  {
   "text": "Einstein works for my phone?",
   "s": 34.34,
   "e": 35.54,
   "line": 13,
   "sp": "B"
  },
  {
   "text": "Skip him,",
   "s": 35.6,
   "e": 35.98,
   "line": 14,
   "sp": "A"
  },
  {
   "text": "and you drift ten",
   "s": 36.04,
   "e": 36.78,
   "line": 14,
   "sp": "A"
  },
  {
   "text": "kilometres a day.",
   "s": 36.84,
   "e": 37.68,
   "line": 14,
   "sp": "A"
  },
  {
   "text": "And in the city,",
   "s": 37.74,
   "e": 38.14,
   "line": 15,
   "sp": "B"
  },
  {
   "text": "between buildings?",
   "s": 38.2,
   "e": 39.14,
   "line": 15,
   "sp": "B"
  },
  {
   "text": "Maps and wifi names",
   "s": 39.2,
   "e": 40.04,
   "line": 16,
   "sp": "A"
  },
  {
   "text": "fill the gaps.",
   "s": 40.1,
   "e": 40.98,
   "line": 16,
   "sp": "A"
  },
  {
   "text": "Okay, but then why were",
   "s": 41.04,
   "e": 41.82,
   "line": 17,
   "sp": "B"
  },
  {
   "text": "we lost last summer?",
   "s": 41.88,
   "e": 42.88,
   "line": 17,
   "sp": "B"
  },
  {
   "text": "The phone knew exactly",
   "s": 42.94,
   "e": 43.7,
   "line": 18,
   "sp": "A"
  },
  {
   "text": "where we were.",
   "s": 43.76,
   "e": 44.69,
   "line": 18,
   "sp": "A"
  },
  {
   "text": "You were the lost one.",
   "s": 44.88,
   "e": 46.05,
   "line": 18,
   "sp": "A"
  }
 ],
